1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:11,500
Lumio Booking - a booking and messaging platform
for nail salons, spas and restaurants.

2
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:27,000
Signing in to the salon dashboard with the test
account provided in this submission.

3
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:41,000
The dashboard of a demo nail salon, with its own
services, staff and opening hours.

4
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:54,000
Marketing and AI, then Messenger bot. This is where
a salon connects its OWN Facebook Page.

5
00:00:55,000 --> 00:01:11,000
Facebook Login for Business. The owner chooses which
Pages, Businesses and Instagram accounts to grant.

6
00:01:12,000 --> 00:01:32,000
We read only the Page name and ID with
pages_read_engagement and pages_show_list.

7
00:01:33,000 --> 00:01:54,000
No posts, insights, comments or ratings are read.
Now from the customer's side, on a real phone.

8
00:01:55,000 --> 00:02:35,000
The assistant answers using the salon's REAL services
and prices - gel manicure, 22 dollars 50.

9
00:02:36,000 --> 00:03:15,000
Opening hours come from the salon's own settings:
open at 9 AM tomorrow.

10
00:03:16,000 --> 00:03:55,000
The customer books a Luxury Manicure for tomorrow at
2 PM. The assistant asks for a name and a phone number.

11
00:03:56,000 --> 00:04:35,000
Booking confirmed, with a link to view or reschedule.
All of it inside Messenger.

12
00:04:36,000 --> 00:04:58,000
The assistant then asks, optionally, for a birthday
so the salon can send a treat.

13
00:04:59,000 --> 00:05:44,000
The appointment now appears in the salon's calendar:
2:00 PM, Anna, Luxury Manicure.

14
00:05:45,000 --> 00:06:10,000
INSTAGRAM DIRECT. The customer opens the salon's
Instagram account, at lumio_bk, and sends a message.

15
00:06:11,000 --> 00:06:50,000
instagram_manage_messages receives this direct
message and sends the reply.

16
00:06:51,000 --> 00:07:45,000
Prices on Instagram come from the same service list:
Shellac Manicure 35 dollars, Nail Design 22 dollars 50.

17
00:07:46,000 --> 00:08:25,000
The customer books a Bio Gel New Set for tomorrow at
3 PM, then gives a name and a phone number.

18
00:08:26,000 --> 00:09:04,000
Confirmed on Instagram Direct. The calendar now holds
TWO appointments, booked from two different channels.

19
00:09:05,000 --> 00:09:35,000
Back in the dashboard, a staff member can take over
any conversation and reply by hand.

20
00:09:36,000 --> 00:10:18,000
The reply is sent to the Instagram thread and arrives
on the customer's phone straight away.

21
00:10:19,000 --> 00:10:40,000
The activity log records every message with its
channel - Instagram and Messenger side by side.

22
00:10:41,000 --> 00:10:58,000
Each row shows the direction and the delivery status:
Received for incoming, Sent for outgoing.

23
00:10:59,000 --> 00:11:08,000
The manual reply just sent from the dashboard
appears here as Sent.

24
00:11:09,000 --> 00:11:19,000
Two bookings, two channels, one inbox - all from the
salon's own connected accounts. Thank you for reviewing.
